Wait, no, no, no.

00:00:39.081 --> 00:00:40.625
We're not playing

00:00:39.081 --> 00:00:40.625
"Have you met Ted?"

00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:42.251
Hi. Have you met Ted?

00:00:43.377 --> 00:00:44.837
<i>So I asked her out.</i>

00:00:44.837 --> 00:00:46.505
<i>And I know this sounds crazy,</i>

