00:17:36.974 --> 00:17:38.099
And I turned it off.

00:17:38.099 --> 00:17:40.518
I mean, look,

00:17:38.099 --> 00:17:40.518
sure, yes,

00:17:40.518 --> 00:17:43.313
I want to fall in love, get

00:17:40.518 --> 00:17:43.313
