00:18:39.202 --> 00:18:42.163
What do we do now?

00:18:43.081 --> 00:18:44.332
We could be friends.

00:18:44.332 --> 00:18:47.085
Oh...

00:18:47.085 --> 00:18:48.461
Look,

00:18:48.461 --> 00:18:51.381
